# ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║ Reporting Gantt — Public Distribution Repo .gitignore              ║
# ║                                                                    ║
# ║ This is a BINARY-DISTRIBUTION repo. The TypeScript source, build   ║
# ║ tooling, and internal artifacts must NEVER be published here.      ║
# ║ The deny-list below is the structural defense against accidents.   ║
# ║                                                                    ║
# ║ What IS allowed (verify before each commit):                       ║
# ║   - README.md, LICENSE.md, EULA.md, CHANGELOG.md, SECURITY.md      ║
# ║   - dist/*.pbiviz (the shipping binary)                            ║
# ║   - docs/**/*.{png,jpg,jpeg,svg,gif}  (screenshots, format-pane)   ║
# ║   - assets/**/*.{png,jpg,jpeg,svg,gif} (visual icon)               ║
# ║   - capabilities.json (schema; extracted from .pbiviz anyway)      ║
# ║   - Demo-Roadmap.pbix (anonymized demo report file)                ║
# ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# ───── Source code (the primary defense) ─────
*.ts
*.tsx
*.d.ts
*.js
*.jsx
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.map
src/

# ───── Build configuration (reveals deps + tooling) ─────
package.json
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
tsconfig*.json
# pbiviz.json INTENTIONALLY ALLOWED — its content (author email, GUID,
# supportUrl, version) is already embedded in every .pbiviz binary that
# ships, so blocking it on the repo doesn't actually protect anything.
eslint.config.*
.eslintrc*
.prettierrc*
.editorconfig
.husky/

# ───── Internal gate artifacts (CORTEX) ─────
.dead-exports-baseline.txt
.file-size-ratchet-baseline.txt
.eslint-baseline.json
.madge-baseline.json
.cortex-gates.yaml

# ───── Dependencies + build output ─────
node_modules/
.tmp/
tmp/
.pbiviz/
.cache/
coverage/
out/
build/

# ───── Internal directories ─────
fixtures/
test/
tests/
__tests__/
.github/workflows/
.vscode/
.idea/
.cursor/
.devcontainer/

# ───── Internal docs / process ─────
CLAUDE.md
*.local.md
INF-*.md
SANDBOX/

# ───── Internal tooling formats (CORTEX-specific) ─────
*.cor
*.sdd
*.ddd
*.pbixray

# ───── Secrets (must NEVER reach a public repo) ─────
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*
*token*
*secret*
.aws/
.azure/
.gcloud/
.npmrc

# ───── OS / editor cruft ─────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.log
